---
const { items = [] } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="py-20 bg-white" id="services">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">How Does Essential Tech Help?</h2>
            <h5 class="text-xl text-primary font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Pay only for what You need When You need iT</h5>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
            <div class="md:w-1/2">
                 <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/002-video-conference.png" alt="Tech Support" class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto" />
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2">
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    Lets face it as a small business owner you probably have better things to worry about than the tech that you need to run your business.&nbsp; Honestly you probably only care about two things: Is it Effectively being used&nbsp;and is it Efficiently being delivered.&nbsp; There is nothing worse in your mind than paying too much for tech when all you really need are the Essentials .
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    &nbsp; Thats why we think our Essential Tech Support Service is the perfect fit for small businesses just like yours.&nbsp; We cover the essentials you need at an affordable monthly rate and provide you with the support you need when you need it.
                </p>
                <div class="flex gap-4 mt-8">
                     <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-blue-50 text-primary font-bold rounded-lg">SECURITY</div>
                     <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-purple-50 text-secondary font-bold rounded-lg">BACKUP</div>
                     <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-green-50 text-green-600 font-bold rounded-lg">SUPPORT</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
